25/491830822_1970154457012933_7566574298106778815_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s5IFESLcdX4Q7kNvwGKSvFy&_nc_oc=AdpNTo0XKN5b5-EtPl9ZcgUFtqt0dZwMYJ4tQc0P_KlwlaYb_YhhfbZ-uXrJzDnnEFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTD65PI5XmfmUPFDeQfHtVjqVixhLdwJCSrT50c5lHPkQ&oe=6AF889A4"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Low Vision Simulator", "keywords": ["simulator", "vision", "blindness", "IRD", "AARP"], "long_description": "The Low Vision Simulator illustrates different symptoms that individuals diagnosed with an Inherited Retinal Dystrophy (IRD) may experience, allowing users to adjust their intensity level.\nThis project is an initiative of the Asociaci\u00f3n Andaluza de Retinosis Pigmentaria (AARP), funded by the Diputaci\u00f3n de Sevilla and developed in technological collaboration with Singular Learning.\nThis simulator is an educational tool and does not replace professional medical diagnosis, treatment or advice. The simulations are pedagogical approximations and do not accurately reproduce each person's individual experience. If you experience changes in your vision, consult a qualified ophthalmologist or optometrist.", "short_description": "The Low Vision Simulator illustrates different symptoms that individuals diagnosed with an Inherited Retinal Dystrophy (IRD) may experience, allowing users to adjust their intensity level."}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "931466113372726", "locale": "es_ES", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Simulador de Baja Visi\u00f3n", "keywords": ["simulador", "visi\u00f3n", "ceguera", "DHR", "AARP"], "long_description": "El Simulador de Baja Visi\u00f3n muestra diferentes sintomatolog\u00edas que pueden padecer las personas que est\u00e1n diagnosticadas de una Distrofia Hereditaria de Retina (DHR) permitiendo establecer diferentes porcentajes de la misma.\nEste proyecto es una iniciativa de 